# CHIP-8 video ISR follow-up: restore R9 increment at end of frame
# Requires prior Netronics-1979-CHIP8-PIXIE-ISR-PATCH-ONLY.hex already loaded in RAM.
# Original 1979 ISR contains INC R9 (19) at $0D4B.
# New ISR previously skipped this heartbeat; patch its exit path:
#   $0E1B: 30 00 -> 19 30 00  (INC R9; BR $0E00)
# No changes to scanline/DMA timing loop, ROM, or cassette code.
:030E1B001930008B
:00000001FF
